  text: "Gpt image 2 via chat gpt\n\nPrompt \n\nCreate a premium 10-second vertical\
    \ 9:16 FMCG yogurt commercial for “CIMOR YOGURT – Strawberry”.\n\nVISUAL STYLE:\n\
    Photorealistic premium food commercial, fresh natural cinematic aesthetic, high-end\
    \ product photography, realistic food physics, crisp details, vibrant but elegant\
    \ colors, cool alpine mountain background, clean luxury advertising look. Use\
    \ the exact Cimory Yogurt Strawberry bottle design, label, cap, proportions and\
    \ branding consistently throughout the entire video. Do not redesign or alter\
    \ the product packaging.\n\nSHOT 1 — 0.0–1.5s | FREEZE:\nOpen with a hero close-up\
    \ of a chilled Cimory Strawberry Yogurt bottle standing among crystal-clear ice\
    \ cubes, fresh strawberries and tiny water droplets. Beautiful mountain landscape\
    \ in the background under bright natural daylight. The bottle slowly begins to\
    \ vibrate with anticipation.\nCamera: low-angle close-up, very slow cinematic\
    \ push-in, then a subtle snap push.\nMotion: bottle gently shakes, ice cubes slightly\
    \ move.\nSFX: low cinematic hum → deep rumble → bass hit.\nOn-screen text:\n“DON’T\
    \ LOOK AWAY.”\nTypography: bold hand-painted editorial style, dark navy with red\
    \ accent.\n\nSHOT 2 — 1.5–3.0s | SHAKE:\nThe yogurt bottle performs a dynamic\
    \ 360-degree spin while floating above a splash of creamy yogurt. Fresh strawberries\
    \ fly dramatically around it in slow motion, with strawberry slices, milk droplets\
    \ and tiny yogurt particles suspended in the air.\nCamera: dynamic orbit, fast\
    \ 360° rotation.\nMotion: bottle spins rapidly while strawberries and liquid swirl\
    \ around it.\nSFX: energetic whoosh, fruit swirl, soft impact.\nOn-screen text:\n\
    “SHAKE THE FRESH.”\n\nSHOT 3 — 3.0–5.0s | POUR:\nExtreme close-up. The Cimory\
    \ yogurt bottle opens and thick, smooth strawberry yogurt pours into a crystal-clear\
    \ transparent glass. The yogurt has a rich creamy texture and naturally falls\
    \ with realistic viscosity. Fresh strawberry pieces appear inside and around the\
    \ glass.\nCamera: extreme macro close-up, push-in and follow-down movement.\n\
    Motion: thick yogurt stream, soft splash, realistic liquid physics.\nSFX: cap\
    \ click → pouring sound → soft creamy splash.\nOn-screen text:\n“CREAMY.”\n\n\
    SHOT 4 — 5.0–7.0s | FRESH CREAMY:\nTransition seamlessly inside the yogurt. Enter\
    \ a mesmerizing macro world of creamy strawberry yogurt swirling like a luxurious\
    \ vortex. Strawberry pieces rotate through the creamy liquid while tiny droplets\
    \ float in the air. Hyper-realistic texture, glossy highlights, rich creamy surface.\n\
    Camera: extreme macro, smooth push-through into the yogurt vortex, then slow motion.\n\
    Motion: elegant creamy swirl, rotating strawberry pieces, suspended droplets.\n\
    SFX: deep liquid swirl → crisp chime.\nOn-screen text:\n“FRESH. CREAMY.”\n\nSHOT\
    \ 5 — 7.0–8.5s | TASTE THE FRESH:\nReveal a finished glass of strawberry yogurt\
    \ in the foreground, filled with creamy pink yogurt and fresh strawberry pieces.\
    \ The Cimory bottle stands clearly behind the glass. A single fresh water droplet\
    \ slides down the bottle and falls onto the table.\nCamera: product close-up,\
    \ smooth lateral pull-back.\nMotion: strawberry pieces settle naturally, water\
    \ droplet falls.\nSFX: water drop → soft impact → uplifting music rise.\nOn-screen\
    \ text:\n“TASTE THE FRESH.”\n\nSHOT 6 — 8.5–10.0s | HERO:\nFinal premium hero\
    \ shot. The Cimory Strawberry Yogurt bottle stands prominently in the center on\
    \ a clean surface surrounded by fresh strawberries, mint leaves and crystal ice.\
    \ Beautiful green alpine mountains fill the background. Subtle sunlight sweeps\
    \ across the bottle, creating realistic highlights and condensation. Additional\
    \ Cimory yogurt bottles are softly blurred in the background.\nCamera: hero close-up,\
    \ slow cinematic push-in, ending in a perfectly composed product frame.\nMotion:\
    \ subtle light sweep, gentle environmental movement.\nSFX: ice clink → music peak\
    \ → clean satisfying end.\n\nFINAL ON-SCREEN TEXT:\n“CIMORYYOGURT”\n“FRESHNESS\
    \ IN EVERY SIP.”\n\nOverall mood: fresh, cheerful, energetic, refreshing, premium\
    \ and appetizing.\nMusic: uplifting cinematic commercial music with a clean modern\
    \ rhythm.\nSound design: crisp, natural, satisfying, dynamic but not overpowering.\n\
    Lighting: bright natural daylight, cool fresh highlights, realistic reflections\
    \ and condensation.\nFood physics: highly realistic, thick creamy yogurt viscosity,\
    \ natural strawberry movement, believable liquid splashes.\nMaintain perfect product\
    \ consistency, realistic label readability, accurate bottle shape and branding\
    \ across every shot.\n\nNEGATIVE PROMPT:\nNo cartoon, no CGI-looking plastic,\
    \ no distorted bottle, no warped label, no changing brand name, no incorrect packaging,\
    \ no extra text, no misspelled text, no deformed strawberries, no unrealistic\
    \ liquid physics, no duplicate bottles in foreground, no people, no hands, no\
    \ camera glitches, no flickering, no morphing, no low resolution, no oversaturated\
    \ colors"
